{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d4e899a5f9264c1cf320654aebe09c387e04a3750d3b68d3896ad15603da9467", "ja": "空猫珈琲店、オープンです！", "zh": "空猫咖啡厅，正式开幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a40f147ef6d348083265d574de39c842f09485d6edef59b8517f75d0d9b02fba", "ja": "『三姉妹カフェ』がクランクイン。それぞれ\nしっかりと役作りをしてきたメンバー達は、\nカメラテストでも生き生きとした演技を\n見せる。この調子なら、きっといい映画に\nなるに違いないと確信するプロデューサー。", "zh": "《三姊妹咖啡厅》正式开拍了。\n成员们都对自己饰演的角色做足功课，\n在试拍时也展现了活灵活现的演技。\n制作人坚信照这个样子进展下去，\n一定能拍出很棒的电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f429ebe825ae7a70d1c73c05f4bd90d477debff8e3a895b5d445f3139a3ad7ce", "ja": "（いよいよ、『三姉妹カフェ』のクランクインだ。\n皆がどんな演技を見せてくれるか、楽しみだな）", "zh": "（《三姊妹咖啡厅》终于正式开拍了。\n不晓得大家会发挥怎样的演技呢，真叫人期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "3a050dbb25f5da1f7c8fb22c1e425e09c628365f24b0cc73b9ecf79f38ac7a5c", "ja": "へえ～、ここが撮影現場のカフェなんだ。\n雰囲気があって、いい感じね♪", "zh": "哦～这里就是拍摄用的咖啡厅啊。\n挺有气氛的，感觉不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "b4c5034f695faab4ef9b286f35d39d58eef999f9caae12e4a55b0f9db788c98e", "ja": "イメージ通りのお店で、何だかドキドキしますね……。\nみんな、撮影、頑張りましょうね♪", "zh": "咖啡厅跟想像中一样，总觉得有点紧张呢……\n大家，拍戏加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6b78f3c0e08c78a96a0b09be96aeaf5166322348408274a6fa872b09dd8e86b8", "ja": "（そして、撮影が始まった……）", "zh": "（接着，拍摄工作开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "b47748d923474b29a004b0cafb5ac7b6bc5d7e87e1257fcbd68d903bbf08b777", "ja": "今日もお日様がポカポカで、いい朝ですな～。\nきっと、素敵な一日になりますぞ～。", "zh": "太阳公公今天也是暖呼呼的，真是和煦的早晨～\n看来又会是美好的一天喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "2270e6cf8445a9f57ed9e587ad5972759126c47ea9c55792d0dd8caee7419f6c", "ja": "おや～？　どうやら一夏さんたちが、\n開店の準備を始めたようですね～。", "zh": "哎呀～？\n看来一夏她们已经在准备开店了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "15b2bb063f8838bb8f6350b4916d0b45465806872bb18af27473f59df0b0af55", "ja": "菜々子ちゃんから聞いたわ、二葉。\n学校の模試で、志望校のA判定をとったんですって？", "zh": "二叶，我听菜菜子说了喔。\n你在学校的模拟考中，拿到了志愿学校的A判定呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "7b8c9965c6422a0bbcddf471262850829ea8814981c62e43b7aa406470d44191", "ja": "小さい頃から、ピアノの勉強をしたがっていたものね。\nお姉ちゃん、二葉の夢、応援してる。", "zh": "你从小就一直想往钢琴方面发展呢。\n姊姊很支持二叶去实现梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "a50ab634493cc6e0dd76e5ee17f03e634d93f0cb6f1c7406ccc61850aea9b64f", "ja": "でも……その高校、遠いよね……。\n二葉お姉ちゃん……家、出ていっちゃうの……？", "zh": "可是……那所高中，很远对吧……\n二叶姊姊……你会离开家吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "0fb8ef4a6d6c00756dea6af6bb27431d4f229e0d6d9295abc6bed963e080c221", "ja": "ううん。心配しないで、三奈。\n私、家から通える高校を受験するから。", "zh": "不会的，三奈不用担心。\n我会去考离家比较近的高中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "b7380dff66ac19b29530c61b65b9689efab450be01ac4b496ee5900d69ce3cfa", "ja": "え……。\n二葉、どうして？", "zh": "咦……\n二叶，这是为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "2662a2401af0a07ee1a8c11e029a6eef344057f603ea74e8da333b02bd96f832", "ja": "え？　だって当然じゃない。私がいなくなったら、\nこの店、やっていけなくなっちゃうでしょ。", "zh": "咦？这还用问，要是我不在，\n这间店不就要收掉了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "6d6c4c27b095ecf7980749f06327b86e1688978cf0b324714e55f8ee8a84667e", "ja": "ここは、お父さんとお母さんが残してくれた大切な店。\n私の料理は、ふたりの思い出の味なんだもの。", "zh": "这是爸爸和妈妈留给我们的宝贝咖啡厅。\n我的料理就是回忆中爸妈的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "dc9f2cf6987fa72752a93ea8872c0018b72fac08c365a03e6d6bbb76c5be87bc", "ja": "そんな……二葉、お店のことは心配しなくていいのよ！\n二葉は、二葉の夢を……。", "zh": "怎么这样……二叶，你不用担心店里的事情！\n二叶就放心去追自己的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e9d910099dc06d6bfabe5eb6afa345cb38690290c92cfa997bdb339d8e9d8a7", "ja": "……できないことを、簡単に言わないで。", "zh": "……明明就做不到，不要说得那么简单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "8fcff37d3ed35ef760a0afe22cef60555cdf1df9a79bbd2082a1ba61d29dd813", "ja": "二葉？", "zh": "二叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff409a4114d661732cfc2d7e6e978f0502a456c3a85e3237b0ae54cbf1496645", "ja": "もう決めたのっ！\n私の進路なんだから、お姉ちゃんは口出ししないで！", "zh": "我已经决定好了！\n我的志愿我自己决定，姊姊你不要插嘴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "e98707ab0f8cf3204fb428563551c313e413528ebb3880003f9f9242721b749b", "ja": "二葉……！", "zh": "二叶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4ebf00a0f33434c6df3bef0f0177c4fba5c047717d81a91b3411dcb12deef438", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nカメラテストとはいえ、迫真の演技だったよ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n虽说只是试拍，但你们的演技好有张力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "562759d537816b4884c743dfcc9d34eeb2150d10f2670ce2b4269d671b5035f4", "ja": "私たちの演じる三姉妹は、両親を亡くしているんです。\n残されたお店を、姉妹が継いでいるという設定で……。", "zh": "我们饰演的三姊妹，父母都不在人世了。\n设定上是三姊妹一起继承父母留下来的咖啡厅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "011939038031f38113c1cf8921b537ce5e32adc63037055680e755ff7692dc41", "ja": "だから二葉は、自分がいなくなって\nお店はやっていけるのか、心配なんですよね。", "zh": "所以二叶很担心自己要是离开，\n咖啡厅还有没有办法经营下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "ad64c1c5f3b4610fd104f77e5be5183fc833f81ad952c161b053b8099e30ccd5", "ja": "大好きなお姉ちゃんたちが、ケンカしちゃって……\n三奈……すごく、悲しいと思うな……。", "zh": "看到最喜欢的姊姊们为此争吵……\n三奈……一定很难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7fb8b4a188ea0311da705926264d9f12dd6a91e58a382a5dd269929bc712e93e", "ja": "一夏も二葉も、家族想いだからこそ\nぶつかってしまったんだろうな。", "zh": "正因为一夏和二叶都很为家人着想，\n才会起冲突吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e46c9bfca6e05e9fc5676938ce29e19f24fa16e5a095ce0b9aee4d1d111502e2", "ja": "さて、次は莉緒の番だな……\n準備はできてるか？", "zh": "好了，接着换莉绪登场……\n你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e7b63d9bb9408dcf1f7d4275d3e049d8d03bcad4381d5c6c5a52b582cd2d75d", "ja": "私はイケメン……私はイケメン……。\n……よしっ！　行けるわ！　いや、行けるぜ？", "zh": "我是帅哥……我是帅哥……\n……好！我可以的！还是该说我行的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6204388528018f385285a8b8383e00625184d9f5e372ee6226e44f684221addc", "ja": "……空回りしないようにな。", "zh": "……小心别拚过头白费力气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1026_null", "source_sha256": "e7e41f6fb8d623dc1e48bbb3970ef3777f0efd47258a41c703d156aab9135892", "ja": "カランカラン", "zh": "框啷框啷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "7757834164febae31a06582e9cdc5e69975216940f6f91c685f59faaebda614b", "ja": "あ、いらっしゃいま……。\nあれ？　もしかして、悠利くん！？", "zh": "啊，欢迎光临……\n咦？你是悠利吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "26dd7308df97633152458c50128b5fac9cc2ca22be29a8deb69d47b8a122e20e", "ja": "え？　そうだけど、君は……。\n……ああ、一夏ちゃんか！", "zh": "咦？是没错，但你是……\n……啊，是一夏呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "a3ec4661d690480f1e696e4009041fbfd65bb61029c43a4c007b75623c8b42d0", "ja": "すぐに気付けなくてゴメン。\n久しぶりだね、一夏ちゃん。", "zh": "抱歉，没有马上发现是你。\n好久不见了，一夏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "120fe6505fa79a5e4a0610867097ec4dcd2c81cae41920f643975e3acaf95fbc", "ja": "……誰？　お姉ちゃんの知り合い？", "zh": "……他是谁？姊姊的熟人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "e9c560182457d9b30e88073786cab67dac33b2eaf13998d6e2ae88ac5cfc5652", "ja": "うん。悠利くんは、中学の同級生なの。\n本当、久しぶり……さ、こちらの席へどうぞ。", "zh": "嗯，悠利是我国中同学。\n真的好久不见了……来，请坐这边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "1129277f8217c00987fe2a09eebf703068e401c0f3317e5f8f2ffc45acf89214", "ja": "（その後も、撮影は続き……）", "zh": "（之后，拍摄工作继续进行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "6958d991c1ce71b359035f8b95b0c446cf1826df60448e8730a6064e417d3d3a", "ja": "二葉、どうかしたの？", "zh": "二叶，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "4573dd293e5b62729534d0d5faf547abc8e95f3d741e8e11bf38729ed55a64bc", "ja": "もう、どうかしたのじゃないわよ。\nお姉ちゃんが甘いから、ネコたちが厨房に……。", "zh": "受不了，还问我怎么了，\n姊姊你就是人太好，这些猫才会跑进厨房……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "0c4bd047785700e3d2be7ced991325419ad30c5331ea9ec1d56bbd6323897ba5", "ja": "ニャ～……。", "zh": "喵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "9c94cc8632e308c956f4263ba4830d880a6fef7c75f3fe6ee9829395be397a62", "ja": "それじゃあ、学校に行ってきます。", "zh": "那我去上学了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1037_052kao", "source_sha256": "818b09cd76aabc1519677d4bee9769545fb2d0c072259a16ac48ac3305fd20d9", "ja": "行ってらっしゃい。\n帰ったら、さっきの話の続きを……。", "zh": "路上小心。\n回来以后，我们再继续商量刚才的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b0bc0ef76d5770050436fc9dbd2d71437ebc5d740ea44c9551a5ff0c26dc3e7", "ja": "言っておくけど、私の考えは変わらないから。", "zh": "我先声明，我不打算改变自己的决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "d3c40c9dd3cde4fb9949108ea648290a96523ab33c44c68d8631f66f12fba886", "ja": "お父さんとお母さんが残した店を、私たちで続ける。\nそのためなら、ピアノは諦める。それでいいの。", "zh": "我们姊妹要一起撑起爸爸妈妈留下来的这家店。\n要我为此放弃钢琴也无妨。这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "4785f21161e984b1a71071de7856fb42fc3cd7bf206a42d497dde5f77448ed4f", "ja": "二葉……。", "zh": "二叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "26a253f590ac0bf844a122cd0ca69a235b255a9dc5b509adc60f932ff787775c", "ja": "本当は、何よりもピアノが大好きなくせに……\nどうしたら本当のことを言ってくれるの……。", "zh": "她明明爱弹琴爱得不得了……\n该怎么做才能让她说出真心话呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "24ede4f6173ad9cba2a5102f26730fc537014f797055410a73ebdb21518574ce", "ja": "むむむ～。一夏さん、悩んでいるみたいですね～。\n何とかしてあげたいですが～。", "zh": "唔唔唔～一夏，好像在烦恼的样子～\n好想为她做点什么，可是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "9993b84343885890e61996d26180f80e59fd8fa2c9f1b0e801e2f52680d56f13", "ja": "こんな時は……三奈ちゃんに、相談しましょう～。\nシッポちゃんにも、手伝ってもらいますよ～。", "zh": "这种时候……就找三奈商量看看吧～\n志尾，你也要来帮忙喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "41bdc44b117e2e1215e5b7cf67497aa372d25668a2173ed4b4cfc2916934ac32", "ja": "待っていてください～、一夏さん～。\n私たちが、必ず恩返ししますからね～。", "zh": "一夏～你再等一下～\n我们一定会报恩的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_06_1045_p", "source_sha256": "03f64a51b5e543100086358f197588c22058a00dcf16399d298d9ebc306d6612", "ja": "（演技をするみんなの表情は、生き生きとしている……\nこの分なら、きっと本番も大丈夫だ！）", "zh": "（大家演戏时的表情都好生动……\n这样看来，正式开拍时肯定也没问题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
